{"hw":"ἀποπειράζω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀποπειράζω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀπο-πειράζω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">make trial of, prove,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. εἰ.. </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mir.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">831a29</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">make an attempt upon,</b> <span class=\"gk\">Μεγάρων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">App.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pun.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">117</span> </span>.</div></div>"}